# Google OAuth 2.0 Configuration
# ---------------------------------------------
# Get your Client ID from: https://console.cloud.google.com/apis/credentials
# Quick setup guide: See GOOGLE_OAUTH_QUICKSTART.md
# Detailed guide: See GOOGLE_OAUTH_SETUP.md
#
# IMPORTANT: Replace the value below with your actual Google OAuth Client ID
# Example: 123456789-abc123.apps.googleusercontent.com
VITE_GOOGLE_CLIENT_ID=759138252953-36i35og3gqjf4isn7u4ad82o1ldg3uvm.apps.googleusercontent.com

# Backend API Configuration
# ---------------------------------------------
# This is the URL where your Spring Boot backend is running
# Default: http://localhost:8080/api
VITE_API_BASE_URL=http://localhost:8080/api

# ============================================
# Setup Instructions:
# ============================================
# 1. Get Google Client ID from Google Cloud Console
# 2. Replace "your_google_client_id_here" with your actual Client ID
# 3. Save this file
# 4. Restart the frontend dev server (npm run dev)
#
# For detailed setup instructions, see:
# - GOOGLE_OAUTH_QUICKSTART.md (5-minute setup)
# - GOOGLE_OAUTH_SETUP.md (comprehensive guide)
